WEBVTT

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:32.456
There is something
about being Black in America

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:33.880
that has made motherhood seem

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:36.360
complicated.

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:38.696
Seem like,

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:40.896
I don't know what to do
to raise my kids right

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:42.256
and keep them alive.

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:44.816
Do I tell my son not to steal
because it is wrong,

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:47.160
or because they will use it
to justify his death?

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:49.016
Do I tell him

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:51.616
that even if he pays
for his Skittles and sweet tea

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:53.736
there will still be those
who will watch him

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:56.256
and see a criminal before child;

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:59.216
who will call the police
and not wait for them to come.

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:01.456
Do I even want the police to come?